  "details": "Starting with build 1330 & surviving into build 1331, sending a chatbox message through OSC causes: \n\n* A fluctuating delay between the moment the chatbox message appears for the receiver & the moment the chatbox sound gets triggered.\n\n* 2-3 repeats of the chatbox sound.\n\nFor this bug to occur, only the person sending the OSC chatbox message must be in the beta. People on the recieving end of the message will have the bug's symptoms whether or not they're in the beta. \n\nSending chatbox messages through the build-in chat interface does not cause the bug.\n\nExample: https://youtu.be/sxfj-mrGyt8",
